# Record Prompt History (Claude flavor)

## Purpose

Maintain Joshua's `prompt.history` as a cross-project, cross-CLI raw prompt provenance record. Preserve **what Joshua said, where, and the smallest useful metadata** for future Codex / Gemini / Claude / Agent conclave work.

This skill is the Claude-side companion to the Codex skill at `~/.codex/skills/record-prompt-history/`. The cross-CLI shared rules live at `references/shared-core-spec.md` (symlinked from the Codex skill so spec edits stay unified). The writer at `scripts/append_prompt_history.py` is also symlinked.

## Where to write — the critical default

Write to **the current project's own `prompt.history`** (i.e. `./prompt.history` relative to the session's cwd). **Never explicit-pass `--history` pointing to a different repo.** Each project maintains its own history file.

The `--agent` field is a label (which dog-named agent recorded the entry); the `--history` field is the file location. They are not the same thing.

Default Claude flavor:
- `--history ./prompt.history` (cwd-relative; let it default)
- `--agent <cwd-basename>-obe` (auto-derived per /obe skill — Claude IS obe)

....

